OL,3,Vupppppp5CTuesday
OL,5,G0350 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FIn Essex, Callum and Alison put
OL,7,     Ftogether a fun-filled menu,
OL,8,     Fdespite Callum's not-so-cheery
OL,9,     Fnature. And there's an outburst
OL,10,     Fover the Essex dialect during
OL,11,     Fdessert at Mike and Carol's.
OL,12,G0445 Kirstie and Phil's Love It or...
OL,13,     F...List It: Kirstie and Phil meet
OL,14,     FHeather and Tim, whose seven-acre
OL,15,     Fhome near Edinburgh has a
OL,16,     Fdysfunctional layout. Tim wants
OL,17,     Fsomewhere more rural but Heather
OL,18,     Fwants to stay put.
